      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nbatch_publish.py - publishes a batch of messages with IDs or attributes\nconsume_event.py - consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue\ndead_letter.py - sends failed messages to a dead-letter destination\nmessage_audit_store.py - Persist processed message records for later lookup\nmessage_safety.py - Check message payload text for unsafe content\nmessage_summary.py - Summarize message processing results\nmessaging_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Pub/Sub Messaging\nmessaging_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Pub/Sub Messaging\npayload_translate.py - Translate customer-facing message payload text\npublish_event.py - publishes a JSON event to a managed messaging topic or queue\n\nCreate consume_event.py in the current working directory.\nTask: consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
